        <part updateMethod="0" lastModifyTime="0">
            <t index="1" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:01,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:05,350</end-time>
                <translation>对人类而言 战争是什么？</translation>
                <original>人間にとって戦争とは何か</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="2" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:08,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:11,694</end-time>
                <translation>试图回答人类这一根源性疑问的</translation>
                <original>人類の根源的な疑問に答えを出そうとした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="3" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:11,694</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:14,500</end-time>
                <translation>人类学家 罗歇·凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>人類学者ロジェ・カイヨワ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="4" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:16,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:19,269</end-time>
                <translation>第二次世界大战结束后不久
第二次世界大戦直後</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="5" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:19,269</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:24,074</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦直面战争的本质</translation>
                <original>カイヨワは戦争の本質と真正面から向き合い</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="6" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:24,074</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:26,020</end-time>
                <translation>撰写了《战争论》
戦争論を執筆しました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="7" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:28,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:32,600</end-time>
                <translation>为什么人类无法避免战争</translation>
                <original>なぜ人類は戦争を避けることができないのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="8" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:35,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:40,580</end-time>
                <translation>（To：也刚好是8月但2019年）
100分de名著 在八月将为你解读《战争论》</translation>
                <original>100分で名著この8月戦争論を読み解いていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="9" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:00,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:06,700</end-time>
                <translation>第1回 近代战争的诞生
第1回　近代的戦争の誕生</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="10" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:07,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:09,800</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著 主持人安部美知子
100分de名著司会の安部みちこです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="11" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:09,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:11,100</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="12" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:11,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:13,920</end-time>
                <translation>本次要介绍的名著是这本</translation>
                <original>今回ご紹介する名著はこちらです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="13" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:13,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:16,300</end-time>
                <translation>罗歇·凯卢瓦的《战争论》</translation>
                <original>ロジェ・カイヨワの戦争論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="14" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:16,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:18,500</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 你知道这本书吗？</translation>
                <original>伊集院さんご存知でしたか?</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="15" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:18,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:22,098</end-time>
                <translation>说来惭愧 这本书的名字 还有…</translation>
                <original>恥ずかしながらこの本の名前もそしてあの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="16" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:22,098</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:24,800</end-time>
                <translation>作者的名字我可能也是第一次听说</translation>
                <original>著者の名前も僕もしかしたら初めて聞くかもしれない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="17" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:24,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:27,203</end-time>
                <translation>我也是第一次听说 第一次读</translation>
                <original>私も初めてで初めて読みましたが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="18" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:27,203</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:32,375</end-time>
                <translation>这是一本直面“人类该如何面对战争”这一重大问题的书</translation>
                <original>人間は戦争とどう向き合うべきかという大きな問題に向き合った本なんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="19" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:32,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,050</end-time>
                <translation>本次我们将分4回来解读这本书</translation>
                <original>今回はこの本を4回にわたって読み解いていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="20" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:36,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,000</end-time>
                <translation>来介绍一下导读老师
指南役のをご紹介します</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="21" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:38,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,600</end-time>
                <translation>哲学家西谷修老师
哲学者の西谷修さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="22" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:41,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,800</end-time>
                <translation>请多关照</translation>
                <original>よろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="23" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:46,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:49,600</end-time>
                <translation>哲学家西谷修
哲学者の西谷修さん</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="24" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:51,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,150</end-time>
                <translation>长年从哲学视角研究战争</translation>
                <original>哲学的な視点から長年戦争について研究を続けてきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="25" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:58,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:01,660</end-time>
                <translation>他将凯卢瓦的《战争论》与现代社会联系起来</translation>
                <original>カイヨワの戦争論を現代社会とつなげて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="26" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:01,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:03,720</end-time>
                <translation>为我们通俗易懂地解读</translation>
                <original>分かりやすく紐解きます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="27" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:04,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:08,750</end-time>
                <translation>那么 首先从《战争论》的基本信息开始了解吧</translation>
                <original>ではまず戦争論の基本情報から見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="28" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:08,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:13,750</end-time>
                <translation>Bellone ou la Pente de la guerre
书名是《战争论：潜伏在我们内心的女神贝罗娜》</translation>
                <original>タイトルは戦争論我々の内に潜む女神ベローナ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="29" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:13,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:17,600</end-time>
                <translation>作者是法国人类学家 罗歇·凯卢瓦（Roger Caillois）</translation>
                <original>著者はフランスの人類学者でロジェ・カイヨワです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="30" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:17,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:21,975</end-time>
                <translation>他在第二次世界大战结束后不久开始执笔
第二次世界大戦直後から執筆しました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="31" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:21,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:25,750</end-time>
                <translation>针对“对人类而言战争是什么？”这一疑问</translation>
                <original>人間にとって戦争とは何かという疑問に対して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="32" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:25,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,075</end-time>
                <translation>他试图从人类学的视角来寻找答案</translation>
                <original>人類学的な視点から答えを導き出そうとしたものです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="33" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:29,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:33,060</end-time>
                <translation>这本书因获联合国教科文组织国际和平文学奖 
でこの本はユネスコ国際平和文学賞を受賞し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="34" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:33,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:35,325</end-time>
                <translation>成了世界名著</translation>
                <original>世界的名著となりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="35" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:35,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:36,900</end-time>
                <translation>首先呢 </translation>
                <original>まずですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="36" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:36,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:39,880</end-time>
                <translation>这个副标题 潜藏于我们内心的</translation>
                <original>この副題の我々の内に潜む</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="37" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:39,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:42,200</end-time>
                <translation>这个女神贝罗娜是？</translation>
                <original>女神ベローナなんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="38" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:42,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,825</end-time>
                <translation>贝罗娜是罗马神话中的战争女神</translation>
                <original>ベローナというのはローマ神話の戦の女神なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="39" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:46,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:50,800</end-time>
                <translation>说到战争之神 大家可能会想到军神马尔斯</translation>
                <original>あのう戦争といいますと軍神マルスというので </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="40" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:50,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:52,750</end-time>
                <translation>他可能更为人熟知</translation>
                <original>よく知られていると思うんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="41" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:52,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:55,720</end-time>
                <translation>如果说马尔斯代表了战争的</translation>
                <original>マルスの方が戦争のいわゆる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="42" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:55,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:59,075</end-time>
                <translation>那种宏大、荣耀的话</translation>
                <original>雄々しさとか栄光とかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="43" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:59,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:01,850</end-time>
                <translation>代表那些方面的话</translation>
                <original>そういう面を代表するとしたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="44" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:01,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:05,550</end-time>
                <translation>那么“贝罗娜”则体现了那些不太被关注的</translation>
                <original>ベローナの方はあまり目を向けられない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="45" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:05,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:08,375</end-time>
                <translation>真实的相互厮杀、</translation>
                <original>リアルな殺し合いだとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="46" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:08,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:12,075</end-time>
                <translation>血肉之躯的伤痛等</translation>
                <original>生身のね肉が傷つくとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="47" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:12,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:15,280</end-time>
                <translation>体现这些方面的 </translation>
                <original>そういう面を体現するのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="48" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:15,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:18,260</end-time>
                <translation>-就是女神贝罗娜呢 -战争阴暗的一面呢</translation>
                <original>-この女神ベローナなんですね -影の方ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="49" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:18,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:22,700</end-time>
                <translation>是的 其实这本书法语原题就是“贝罗娜”（Bellone）</translation>
                <original>そうなんです実は本の元のタイトルはベローナっていうんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="50" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:22,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:23,850</end-time>
                <translation>就直接是</translation>
                <original>そのまんま</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="51" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:23,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:26,489</end-time>
                <translation>这其中 大概就体现了凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>そこにまあおそらくカイヨワのね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="52" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:26,489</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:29,025</end-time>
                <translation>思考战争这件事时</translation>
                <original>この戦争を考えるっていうことに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="53" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:29,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:33,375</end-time>
                <translation>所持有的一种基本态度吧</translation>
                <original>ついての基本的な姿勢っていうのが表されてるんじゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="54" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:33,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:35,225</end-time>
                <translation>能从这个书名中看出来</translation>
                <original>そういうタイトルです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="55" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:35,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:38,568</end-time>
                <translation>另外 对于“战争是什么”这个疑问 </translation>
                <original>あと戦争とは何かという疑問に対し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="56" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:38,568</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:40,970</end-time>
                <translation>他是从人类学的视角来尝试探究这一点的</translation>
                <original>人類学的な視点から答えを導き出そうとした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="57" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:40,970</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:43,973</end-time>
                <translation>这跟历史学家谈论的战争 </translation>
                <original>なんか歴史の学者が戦争の話をするとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="58" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:43,973</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:46,440</end-time>
                <translation>或者社会学家谈论的战争</translation>
                <original>社会学者が戦争の話をするのとはちょっと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="59" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:46,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:48,550</end-time>
                <translation>切入路径也会有所不同呢</translation>
                <original>もあアプローチ違いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="60" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:48,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:50,947</end-time>
                <translation>人类的生活呀
人間の生活とかね</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="61" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:50,947</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:53,060</end-time>
                <translation>或者说生存·社会的整体形态</translation>
                <original>あるいは生存社会のあり方</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="62" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:53,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:56,600</end-time>
                <translation>全部都被投入到了战争之中</translation>
                <original>全部が戦争の中に投入されたわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="63" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:56,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:00,625</end-time>
                <translation>人类在文明的尽头 最终走向了这样的战争</translation>
                <original>人類が文明の果てにこういう戦争に行き着いたと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="64" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:04:00,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:04,294</end-time>
                <translation>这是不是可以说在人类之中</translation>
                <original>そうすると人間の中に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="65" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:04:04,294</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:09,575</end-time>
                <translation>具有一种一种奔向战争的倾向呢？</translation>
                <original>その戦争へと向かう傾きがあるんではないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="66" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:09,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:11,934</end-time>
                <translation>是说人类之中 本就有啊</translation>
                <original>人間の中にもうあるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="67" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:11,934</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:15,350</end-time>
                <translation>那种趋向战争的性质</translation>
                <original>その戦争に向かっていく性質というか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="68" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:15,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:18,150</end-time>
                <translation>-难道不存在吗？ -反问！</translation>
                <original>-あるんではないか　-ないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="69" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:18,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:21,825</end-time>
                <translation>可以说 正是因为有这种担忧 才要设想这一点</translation>
                <original>むしろだからそちらの方を想定して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="70" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:21,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:24,900</end-time>
                <translation>回顾过去的一切就会发现…</translation>
                <original>起こったことを振り返ってみると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="71" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:24,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:27,450</end-time>
                <translation>总觉得有些可怕 莫名的</translation>
                <original>ちょっと怖いななんか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="72" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:27,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:32,740</end-time>
                <translation>那么首先 让我们来看看凯卢瓦撰写《战争论》的背景吧</translation>
                <original>ではまずはカイヨワが戦争論を執筆したその背景を見てみましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="73" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:34,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:36,359</end-time>
                <translation>罗歇·凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>ロジェ・カイヨワ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="74" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:36,359</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:39,825</end-time>
                <translation>他出生于1913年</translation>
                <original>彼が生まれたのは1913年</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="75" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:39,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:43,625</end-time>
                <translation>第一次世界大战爆发的前一年
第一次世界大戦が始まる前の年でした</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="76" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:45,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:50,750</end-time>
                <translation>第一次世界大战颠覆了欧洲的价值观
第一次世界大戦はヨーロッパの価値観を転換させ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="77" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:50,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:53,140</end-time>
                <translation>社会陷入了极度混乱</translation>
                <original>社会は混乱を極めていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="78" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:55,365</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:58,047</end-time>
                <translation>生活在那个时代的凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>そんな時代を生きたカイヨワは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="79" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:58,047</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:04,700</end-time>
                <translation>对以往支撑欧洲文明的理性主义和物质主义产生了怀疑</translation>
                <original>それまでのヨーロッパ文明を支えていた合理主義や物質主義に疑問を抱きました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="80" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:05,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:11,861</end-time>
                <translation>在一个只认可合理且有用事物的社会中</translation>
                <original>合理的で役に立つものだけが良いとされる社会の中で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="81" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:11,861</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:16,025</end-time>
                <translation>正是那些无用且非理性的东西驱动着人类
無駄で非合理的なものが人間を突き動かし</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="82" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:17,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:22,550</end-time>
                <translation>走向了全面战争 这便是他的推测</translation>
                <original>全面戦争へ向かっていったのではないかと推察</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="83" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:22,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:27,550</end-time>
                <translation>为了查明原因 他将非理性的事物</translation>
                <original>その原因を突き止めるため非合理的なもの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="84" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:27,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:31,547</end-time>
                <translation>如节日和游戏视作神圣的事物</translation>
                <original>祭りや遊びを聖なるものと捉え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="85" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:31,547</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:36,175</end-time>
                <translation>并分析道 这些对人类而言或许是必要的</translation>
                <original>人間にとって必要なものではないかと分析しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="86" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:37,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:45,575</end-time>
                <translation>1939年 他发表了《人与神圣》</translation>
                <original>1939年に『人間と聖なるもの』を発表</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="87" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:45,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:50,600</end-time>
                <translation>凭借此书奠定了人类学家地位后的凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>この本によって人類学者としての地位を築いたカイヨワは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="88" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:50,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:55,140</end-time>
                <translation>受邀前往阿根廷进行演讲</translation>
                <original>講演のためアルゼンチンに招かれます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="89" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:55,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:57,540</end-time>
                <translation>抵达阿根廷后不久
アルゼンチン到着後</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="90" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:57,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:00,440</end-time>
                <translation>第二次世界大战便爆发了</translation>
                <original>すぐに第二次世界大戦が勃発</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="91" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:02,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:06,916</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦直到战争结束都无法返回法国</translation>
                <original>カイヨワは終戦までフランスに帰国できなくなり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="92" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:06,916</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:11,240</end-time>
                <translation>从而得以客观地审视欧洲的战火</translation>
                <original>ヨーロッパの戦火を客観的に見つめることになります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="93" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:13,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:17,860</end-time>
                <translation>基于这些经历 他耗费了十余年岁月</translation>
                <original>こうした経験をもとに10年以上の歳月をかけて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="94" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:17,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:21,350</end-time>
                <translation>完成了《战争论》</translation>
                <original>戦争論を書き上げたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="95" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:21,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:27,240</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦如下记录了撰写《战争论》的目的</translation>
                <original>カイヨワは戦争論執筆の目的を次のように記しています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="96" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:29,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:32,642</end-time>
                <translation>本书并非研究战争本身</translation>
                <original>Elle n'est donc pas une étude de la guerre elle-même, </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="97" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:32,642</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:41,975</end-time>
                <translation>而是研究战争如何吸引人的心灵与精神并使之陶醉</translation>
                <original>mais de la fascination que la guerre exerce sur le cœur et sur l'esprit humain. </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="98" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:41,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:46,222</end-time>
                <translation>进而本书首先想要划清战争这一社会重压</translation>
                <original>J’estimais devoir d’abord circonscrire les réalités </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="99" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:46,222</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:53,796</end-time>
                <translation>已成为可怕的、压倒性的现实已然压在我们身上 </translation>
                <original>déjà redoutables et écrasantes de la pesanteur sociale, </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="100" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:53,796</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:56,098</end-time>
                <translation>进而更清晰地揭示它造成的危险</translation>
                <original>afin de mieux mettre en lumière les dangers supplémentaires </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="101" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:56,098</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:05,275</end-time>
                <translation>即来自每个人的意识的令人晕眩的不断回荡</translation>
                <original>qui viennent de leur répercussion éblouie dans la conscience individuelle.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="102" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:06,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:09,312</end-time>
                <translation>开头这部分让我非常认同的点在于</translation>
                <original>すごく、最初にすごく納得できたのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="103" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:09,312</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:11,650</end-time>
                <translation>我们一个劲地追求合理 合理化呢</translation>
                <original>合理的に合理的にあるじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="104" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:11,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:13,983</end-time>
                <translation>这就会导致某种压力就会不断累积</translation>
                <original>でそうすると何かストレスが溜まっていってね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="105" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:13,983</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:17,225</end-time>
                <translation>那些被认为是毫无意义的游戏和节日</translation>
                <original>あんな意味のないものと思っているような遊びや祭り</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="106" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:17,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:19,188</end-time>
                <translation>确实会变得令人渴望呢</translation>
                <original>確かに欲しくなりますまでは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="107" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:19,188</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:21,557</end-time>
                <translation>我之前是非常热衷于此的</translation>
                <original>僕はすごい前のめりだったんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="108" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
