            <t index="169" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:09,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:15,075</end-time>
                <translation>战争与武器的研发和军队的组织化密不可分
戦争は兵器の開発や軍の組織化と切り離せません</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="170" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:16,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:21,197</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦认为战争与文明密切相关</translation>
                <original>カイヨワは戦争と文明が密接に関係していると考え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="171" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:21,197</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:23,465</end-time>
                <translation>并这样说道</translation>
                <original>次のように言いました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="172" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:24,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:29,305</end-time>
                <translation>认为战争是文明的反面，这种说法是不准确的，</translation>
                <original>Il est inexact, sauf au point de vue moral et pour l’étymologie, </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="173" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:29,305</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:37,075</end-time>
                <translation>如果不是从道德评价和词源意义上看。</translation>
                <original>que la guerre soit le contraire de la civilisation.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="174" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:37,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:41,083</end-time>
                <translation>它如影随形地伴随着文明，</translation>
                <original>elle l'accompagne comme son ombre </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="175" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:41,083</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:44,725</end-time>
                <translation>与文明一同成长
文明と共に成長する</translation>
                <original>et grandit avec elle.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="176" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:44,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:49,458</end-time>
                <translation>同样，许多人曾声称战争就是文明本身，甚至某种程度上创造了文明，这种说法也是不正确的。</translation>
                <original>Il n'est pas vrai non plus, comme beaucoup l'ont prétendu, </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="177" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:49,458</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:53,362</end-time>
                <translation>甚至某种程度上创造了文明，</translation>
                <original>que la guerre soit la civilisation même </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="178" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:53,362</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:55,975</end-time>
                <translation>这种说法也是不正确的。</translation>
                <original>et qu'elle l'engendre en quelque sorte : </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="179" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:55,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:59,800</end-time>
                <translation>因为文明是和平的产物</translation>
                <original>la civilisation est œuvre de paix.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="180" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:11:59,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:05,390</end-time>
                <translation>然而战争却体现了文明</translation>
                <original>Mais la guerre exprime la civilisation.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="181" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:06,590</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:08,677</end-time>
                <translation>在西方近代思想中
西洋の近代思想では</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="182" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:08,677</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:13,415</end-time>
                <translation>人们认为文明只有在和平中才能发展</translation>
                <original>文明は平和の中でこそ発展すると考えられ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="183" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:13,415</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:20,850</end-time>
                <translation>认为文明进步后 人类就会避免野蛮的战争</translation>
                <original>文明が進めば人間は野蛮な戦争を避けると思われていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="184" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:20,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:25,575</end-time>
                <translation>文明的原理是知性之光照亮的启蒙</translation>
                <original>文明の原理は知性の光による啓蒙であることが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="185" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:25,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:30,200</end-time>
                <translation>这是自古希腊文明以来的西方传统</translation>
                <original>ギリシャ文明以来の西洋の伝統でした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="186" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:30,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:35,638</end-time>
                <translation>然而 在追求用光照亮一切的最终结果</translation>
                <original>しかしそうして光で照らし出すことを追い求めていった果てに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="187" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:35,638</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:37,360</end-time>
                <translation>却产生了像原子弹那样</translation>
                <original>原爆のような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="188" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:37,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:41,400</end-time>
                <translation>足以灼瞎双眼的过度暴力的光</translation>
                <original>目を焼きつぶすほどの過剰な暴力の光を生んだのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="189" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:44,390</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:49,385</end-time>
                <translation>总之 战争随着文明的发展</translation>
                <original>要するに戦争は文明が発達すればするほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="190" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:49,385</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:51,965</end-time>
                <translation>变得愈发野蛮和具有毁灭性</translation>
                <original>野蛮で破滅的になっているのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="191" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:53,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:56,358</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦直面这个矛盾</translation>
                <original>カイヨワはこの矛盾に向き合い</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="192" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:56,358</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:59,065</end-time>
                <translation>试图找出答案</translation>
                <original>答えを導き出そうとしました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="193" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:02,665</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:06,375</end-time>
                <translation>战争与文明</translation>
                <original>戦争と文明</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="194" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:06,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:11,440</end-time>
                <translation>关于凯卢瓦是如何论述战争与文明的</translation>
                <original>カイヨワが戦争と文明についてどう書いていたかというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="195" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:11,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:13,976</end-time>
                <translation>我们来看一下最后这部分</translation>
                <original>この最後の方を見ていきますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="196" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:13,976</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:17,340</end-time>
                <translation>因为文明是和平的产物</translation>
                <original>la civilisation est œuvre de paix.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="197" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:17,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:21,875</end-time>
                <translation>然而战争却体现了文明</translation>
                <original>Mais la guerre exprime la civilisation.</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="198" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:21,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:24,550</end-time>
                <translation>乍一听似乎有些矛盾</translation>
                <original>なんか相反するような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="199" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:24,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:28,700</end-time>
                <translation>文明始于农耕社会
文明は農耕社会から始まります</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="200" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:28,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:32,140</end-time>
                <translation>如果没有几个月的和平</translation>
                <original>何ヶ月間か平和でないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="201" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:32,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:34,050</end-time>
                <translation>就无法收获稻米</translation>
                <original>米も取れないわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="202" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:34,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:37,340</end-time>
                <translation>所以 为了创造财富 必须要保持和平</translation>
                <original>だから富を作るためには平和でないといけないんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="203" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:37,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:41,340</end-time>
                <translation>和平的结果 文明与财富一同诞生</translation>
                <original>その結果富とともに文明が生まれるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="204" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:41,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:43,340</end-time>
                <translation>随之也带来了稳定</translation>
                <original>で安定も生まれるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="205" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:43,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:48,340</end-time>
                <translation>这样看来 文明确实是和平的产物</translation>
                <original>と考えると文明というのはまさに平和の産物だと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="206" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:48,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:51,714</end-time>
                <translation>然而 接下来就会发生战争</translation>
                <original>ところが次に戦争になる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="207" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:51,714</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:57,400</end-time>
                <translation>由文明所创造的一切都会被投入其中</translation>
                <original>とその文明によって生み出されたもののすべてがつぎ込まれるという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="208" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:57,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:59,822</end-time>
                <translation>这时收获的稻米</translation>
                <original>そこで収穫した米や</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="209" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:59,822</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:02,700</end-time>
                <translation>以及存放这些稻米的米仓等</translation>
                <original>その米をためている米蔵やそういうものが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="210" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:02,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:04,293</end-time>
                <translation>在这一切都建成之后</translation>
                <original>全部出来上がったところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="211" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:04,293</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:08,875</end-time>
                <translation>- 才会开始产生想要夺取这些东西的念头 - 大致如此</translation>
                <original>-初めてあれが欲しいという話になっていくわけです　-大体そうです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="212" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:08,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:13,102</end-time>
                <translation>然后 和平期间制造的锄头和犁这些铁器</translation>
                <original>でその平和な時間に作ったクワやスキという刃物で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="213" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:13,102</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:14,670</end-time>
                <translation>发现用那个也能杀人</translation>
                <original>あれだと人が殺せるぞ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="214" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:14,670</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:17,325</end-time>
                <translation>- 事情就变成了这样 - 用途发生了变化</translation>
                <original>-という話になるわけですね　-使い方が変わると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="215" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:17,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:19,340</end-time>
                <translation>真是一种循环往复的感觉呢</translation>
                <original>本当に循環している感じですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="216" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:19,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:24,275</end-time>
                <translation>但是啊 战争在这样能够循环的时候倒还好</translation>
                <original>それがねそういう風にして循環ができる間はいいんですけどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="217" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:24,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:28,650</end-time>
                <translation>“世界大战”已经彻底打破了这种循环</translation>
                <original>世界戦争というのはもう循環を絶っちゃったわけですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="218" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:28,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:32,175</end-time>
                <translation>这已经无法视作一种连续了</translation>
                <original>それはね連続としては考えられないんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="219" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:32,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:35,200</end-time>
                <translation>- 从某种意义上说 是走到了尽头吧 - 是的</translation>
                <original>-ある意味行き着いたところというか　-そう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="220" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:35,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:38,394</end-time>
                <translation>至于之后该怎么办</translation>
                <original>それからどうするかっていうのはね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="221" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:38,394</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:42,725</end-time>
                <translation>就是还抱着和以往一样的想法是不行的</translation>
                <original>今までと同じようなことを考えてたらダメなんだっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="222" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:42,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:45,367</end-time>
                <translation>要在看清其原因和结果之后</translation>
                <original>そのなぜどうなるを見極めてから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="223" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:45,367</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:46,860</end-time>
                <translation>迈出新的一步</translation>
                <original>一歩踏み出さないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="224" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:46,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:50,800</end-time>
                <translation>不然恐怕同样的事情还会再次发生</translation>
                <original>同じことはこれどうやら起こりますってことですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="225" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:50,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:53,409</end-time>
                <translation>想要基于以往既有的思维方式</translation>
                <original>今までの既存の考え方をベースにして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="226" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:53,409</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:56,712</end-time>
                <translation>得出“这样做就好了”的经验教训</translation>
                <original>こうすればいいですよというノウハウとしてはね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="227" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:56,712</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:00,625</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得也当然是不可能的</translation>
                <original>当然ながら出てこないんだと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="228" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:00,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:05,875</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦为了进一步探究文明与战争的关系</translation>
                <original>カイヨワは文明と戦争の関係をさらに掘り下げるため</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="229" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:05,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:09,900</end-time>
                <translation>考察了战争的变化过程</translation>
                <original>戦争がどう変化してきたのかを考察しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="230" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:15:11,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:16,065</end-time>
                <translation>首先 在没有身份差别的未开化阶段的社会中</translation>
                <original>la guerre des sociétés peu différenciées, </original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="231" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:15:16,065</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:20,575</end-time>
                <translation>作为部落间争斗的原始战争</translation>
                <original>qui met aux prises des tribus aux moyens et aux institutions rudimentaires ;</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="232" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:22,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:25,307</end-time>
                <translation>在还不存在国家的时代
国家なども存在しない時代</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="233" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:25,307</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:30,875</end-time>
                <translation>部落这样的小集团之间围绕地盘等进行的战争
部族という小集団同士が縄張りなどで争う戦争です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="234" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:15:32,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:36,585</end-time>
                <translation>其次 在阶层化的法治社会中
la guerre des sociétés féodales ou hiérarchiques, </translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="235" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:15:36,585</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:43,290</end-time>
                <translation>作为专业化的贵族阶级职能的战争 即贵族战争</translation>
                <original>qui apparaît comme la fonction d'une aristocratie spécialisée ;</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="236" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:44,765</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:47,529</end-time>
                <translation>到了中世纪的封建时代
中世の封建時代になると</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="237" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:47,529</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:50,299</end-time>
                <translation>拥有进行战争这一特权身份
戦争をする特権的な身分である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="238" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:50,299</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:53,769</end-time>
                <translation>以骑士阶级的贵族为中心
騎士階級の貴族が中心となって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="239" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:53,769</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:58,850</end-time>
                <translation>开始为了王家的名誉和领土而进行战争</translation>
                <original>王家の名誉や領土のために戦争を行うようになります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="240" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:59,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:04,346</end-time>
                <translation>一般民众即使会被破坏农田和家园</translation>
                <original>一般の民衆は農地や家を荒らされたり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="241" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:04,346</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:09,218</end-time>
                <translation>或是为了凑人数而被拉去当兵</translation>
                <original>頭数を揃えるために兵として連れられていくことはあっても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="242" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:09,218</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:14,250</end-time>
                <translation>基本上他们与战争的目的完全无关
基本的に戦争の目的には全く関係ありません</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="243" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:15,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:19,825</end-time>
                <translation>这类战争有时也会通过骑士们的决斗来决定胜负</translation>
                <original>勝負は騎士たちの決闘で決めることもありました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="244" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:19,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:23,132</end-time>
                <translation>目的并非全歼敌人</translation>
                <original>敵を全滅させることが目的ではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="245" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:23,132</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:26,815</end-time>
                <translation>一旦决出胜负 战争便宣告结束</translation>
                <original>勝負が決まれば戦争は終結したのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="246" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:28,790</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:32,500</end-time>
                <translation>此外 虽然也有雇佣佣兵的情况 </translation>
                <original>また傭兵を雇うこともありましたが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="247" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:32,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:36,965</end-time>
                <translation>但其数量受到王室财政的制约</translation>
                <original>その数は王家の財政によって制約されていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="248" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:39,190</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,985</end-time>
                <translation>由此可以认为 杀戮和破坏的程度</translation>
                <original>こうしたことから殺戮や破壊の度合いは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="249" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:42,985</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:45,490</end-time>
                <translation>此前是受到限制的</translation>
                <original>制限されていたと考えられます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="250" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:47,865</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:49,291</end-time>
                <translation>接着</translation>
                <original>そして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="251" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:49,291</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:53,862</end-time>
                <translation>国家之间倾尽各自国力相互对抗的国民战争 
国家同士がそれぞれの国力をぶつけ合う国民戦争</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="252" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:53,862</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:58,500</end-time>
                <translation>即国民拿起枪作为士兵战斗的战争</translation>
                <original>国民が銃を取って兵士として戦う戦争です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="253" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:16:58,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:01,775</end-time>
                <translation>成为了战争的转折点</translation>
                <original>ここが戦争の転機となりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="254" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:03,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:12,350</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦分析认为 向国民战争转变的契机在于法国大革命</translation>
                <original>国民戦争に移行したきっかけはフランス革命にある とカイヨワは分析しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="255" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:12,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:14,660</end-time>
                <translation>1789年</translation>
                <original>1789年</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="256" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:14,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:17,760</end-time>
                <translation>市民们主张自由与平等
市民たちが自由や平等を主張し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="257" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:17,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:21,050</end-time>
                <translation>法国大革命爆发</translation>
                <original>フランス革命が勃発</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="258" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:21,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:25,427</end-time>
                <translation>以国王和贵族为中心的封建社会崩溃 
王や貴族を中心とした封建社会が崩壊し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="259" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:25,427</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:29,215</end-time>
                <translation>以国民为主体的民族国家得以建立
国民主体の国民国家が樹立されました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="260" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:30,715</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:34,303</end-time>
                <translation>然而 周边的君主制国家
しかしその後周辺の王政諸国が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="261" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:34,303</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:37,015</end-time>
                <translation>随后企图推翻革命政府</translation>
                <original>革命政府を倒そうと企てます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="262" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:38,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:45,525</end-time>
                <translation>对此 革命政府引入了从民众中招募士兵的征兵制 
これに対し民衆から兵士を募る徴兵制を導入</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="263" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:45,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:47,483</end-time>
                <translation>拿破仑挺身而出</translation>
                <original>ナポレオンが立ち上がり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="264" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:47,483</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:51,100</end-time>
                <translation>创建了由国民组成的军队</translation>
                <original>国民による軍隊を作ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="265" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:51,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:56,675</end-time>
                <translation>这便是国民军的开端</translation>
                <original>これが国民軍の始まりでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="266" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:17:56,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:00,129</end-time>
                <translation>要说拿破仑军队为何强大</translation>
                <original>ナポレオン軍がなぜ強いかって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="267" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:00,129</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:04,150</end-time>
                <translation>是因为他们并非为王室征召、缺乏斗志的军队 </translation>
                <original>王家のために徴集されたやる気のない軍隊ではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="268" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:04,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:08,837</end-time>
                <translation>而是为了自己保卫通过革命获得的自由而聚集起来的、</translation>
                <original>革命によって得た自由を自分たちで守るために集まった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="269" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:08,837</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:10,950</end-time>
                <translation>充满斗志的军队</translation>
                <original>やる気のある軍隊だったからです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="270" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:12,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:16,825</end-time>
                <translation>在使全民战争成为可能的拿破仑战争中 </translation>
                <original>万人による戦争が可能になったナポレオン戦争では</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="271" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:16,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:21,700</end-time>
                <translation>任何国民都能够拿起武器战斗</translation>
                <original>国民の誰もが武器を手に戦うことができるようになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="272" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:22,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:27,775</end-time>
                <translation>从封建制转变为民主的民族国家 
封建制から民主的な国民国家になったことで</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="273" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:27,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:30,540</end-time>
                <translation>能够动用所有可参战的国民</translation>
                <original>戦闘可能なすべての国民と</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="274" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:30,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:35,631</end-time>
                <translation>以及国家财政极限内的资金 </translation>
                <original>国家財政の枠いっぱいまでの資金を使うことができるようになり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="275" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:35,631</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:38,925</end-time>
                <translation>战争最终因此变得无法遏制</translation>
                <original>戦争はいよいよ歯止めが効かなくなります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="276" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:42,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:45,500</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦认为拿破仑战争之后 </translation>
                <original>カイヨワはナポレオン戦争によって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="277" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:18:45,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:49,500</end-time>
                <translation>战争已接近其纯粹形态</translation>
                <original>戦争が純粋な形態に近づいたと考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="278" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:51,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:57,725</end-time>
                <translation>火枪创造了步兵 步兵创造了民主主义</translation>
                <original>Le mousquet fit le fantassin, qui fit le démocrate</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="279" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:57,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:00,822</end-time>
                <translation>平民过着悲惨的生活
平民は惨めな生活をし</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="280" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:00,822</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:04,125</end-time>
                <translation>习惯了默默忍受</translation>
                <original>黙って耐え忍ぶことに慣れてきた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="281" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:04,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:07,863</end-time>
                <translation>然而 一旦他们手中被赋予了枪支</translation>
                <original>けれども一旦その手に銃を与えられ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="282" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:07,863</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:11,400</end-time>
                <translation>被号召起来保卫国家之时</translation>
                <original>国民を防衛するために呼び寄せられたとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="283" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:11,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:15,825</end-time>
                <translation>他们才第一次意识到自身价值的重要性
初めて彼らは自分の価値の重要さを意識した</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="284" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:16,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:19,107</end-time>
                <translation>面对重重危险
数々の危険に立ち向かい</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="285" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:19,107</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:21,076</end-time>
                <translation>通过杀死敌人</translation>
                <original>敵を殺すことにより</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="286" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
