            <t index="349" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:47,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,200</end-time>
                <translation>但这真的已经做不到了</translation>
                <original>けれども本当にもうそれはできないんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="350" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:52,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:54,200</end-time>
                <translation>人为什么要思考</translation>
                <original>人は何で考えるのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="351" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:54,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:56,525</end-time>
                <translation>又为什么要试图理解呢</translation>
                <original>でなぜ理解しようとするのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="352" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:56,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:00,425</end-time>
                <translation>可以说是为了寻找经验教训</translation>
                <original>それはノウハウを探すためという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="353" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:00,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:01,900</end-time>
                <translation>当然是有这一面的</translation>
                <original>もちろんそれもあります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="354" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:01,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:05,267</end-time>
                <translation>但在不知如何是好的状态下</translation>
                <original>けれどもどうしていいかわからない状態で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="355" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:05,267</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:07,936</end-time>
                <translation>怎样确认自己脚下的路？</translation>
                <original>足元をどう確かめるか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="356" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:07,936</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,100</end-time>
                <translation>也是在思考这个呢</translation>
                <original>っていうことで考えるわけですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="357" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:11,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:15,750</end-time>
                <translation>这样想时 也不需要急着得出答案</translation>
                <original>そうすると答えがすぐに出なくても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="358" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:15,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:19,950</end-time>
                <translation>为之后得出答案创造立足点</translation>
                <original>答えをこれから作っていく足場って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="359" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:19,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,075</end-time>
                <translation>我认为这才是思考最重要的作用</translation>
                <original>それが考えるっていうことのね一番重要な役割だと思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="360" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:27,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:28,500</end-time>
                <translation>不知道是否还来得及</translation>
                <original>間に合うのかどうかわからないです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="361" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:28,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,760</end-time>
                <translation>不过 比起放弃</translation>
                <original>あのただまあ諦めるよりは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="362" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:31,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:35,040</end-time>
                <translation>我还是想多了解一点 所以只有四晚</translation>
                <original>少しでも知りたいと思うので四夜ですけどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="363" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:35,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:38,525</end-time>
                <translation>好的 下次再读得更深入一些吧</translation>
                <original>はい、次回はちょっとさらに深く読んでいきたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="364" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:38,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:41,615</end-time>
                <translation>西谷老师 非常感谢</translation>
                <original>西谷さん今回はありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="365" torder="1" vertical="0" time="" id="" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:41,615</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:42,615</end-time>
